    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūnganikīla Solomoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyaja līlegeela kūshika ī likanza lya kūcha kwakwe ū Daūdi, ūnganikīla ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Solomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūng'wīla, “Ū nene negeelaga kūja ūko bakajaga pye a banhū; na lūūlū idadīlage ooleche gīkī ūlī ngosha apandile hasī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wīdime īyo SEEBA Mulungu wako ayīhelile, kūshimīzīla mu nzīla jakwe, kūgadima a malange gakwe na a kahelele kakwe, nī shilagīlo shakwe, nī yīngī īyo ayīhayile, gīt'ūmo yandīkilwe mu shilagīlo sha ng'wa Musa; ū mu gīko h'ūkūbiza na būlī kwene ūko ūkūja, nū mu yose īyo ūkwīyīta.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū mu gīko ū SEEBA akūkūshikīlīgīja būlī mhayo ūyo akanisagīja alīhaya, “A banhū ba shibyalīlwe shako ūlū bilang'hana ū mū kikalīle kabo, būshimīza mu būshikanu na ng'holò īmò ū kū būtongi wane shikū jose ja būlamu wabo, a henaho ūtūgayiwa munhū wa kwigasha a h'isumbī lya būtemi wa Isilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū ū bebe ūmanile gete īyo wanītīla ū Yoabu ū ng'wana Seluya, ūmo akabīītīla bataale babīlī ba mabità ga bashilikale ba Isilaeli, ū Abuneeli ng'witūnja o ng'wa Neeli nū Amasa ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yaseeli. A banhū benabo akababūlaga ng'wikanza lya mhola, a mininga gabo ūgiita gītī balī ng'wikanza lya būlūgū; mininga ga mhola gūsosohaja nshipi gwakwe mu nkīmbīlī, na shilatū kū mhambala jakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ng'wītīlage īyo īng'wigeleelilwe, kūlenganīla nū mumo galī masala gako; gwike ilang'hange ūtizūgūleka ū ntwe gwakwe ū gwape gwenūyo gwike mu shigila gūlī mhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bitūnja ba ng'wa Bazilai ū muna Gileadi, a bene bīītīlage yawiza; bazunīlījage babize hamò na banhū abo bigelile kūlya hamò nang'ho ha meza īmò. Nguno a banhū benabo baalī bīmīīla hīgīyī hamò nane aho naalī ng'wikanza lya kūmpeela nkūlūyo Abusalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama izūkagwa nī gīkī ataalī alīho hamò nang'ho ū Shimei ū muna Bahulimu, ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Gela, ū wa lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini. Ū lūshikū lwene najaga Mahanaimu wanidūkīla no ū mu nzīla, alīyo aho wiza kū mongo gwa Yolodani kūnisūng'wanha, nakang'wilahīlīla mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA gīkī, “Natūkūbūlaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Natūkūbūlaga:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, Natūkūbūlaga na līlūshū.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ī haha yaya ū kūng'wisaaba gīkī atī nkenaagūji; nīyo īkī ūlī munhū wa masala ūkūdeeba ū gwa kūng'wītīla; ū ntwe gwakwe ū gwape gwenūyo ūgūhilimīkīje ū mu shigila gūlī na mininga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Daūdi ūlaala na bataale bakwe, ūjīkwa mu nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli walī wabasuga ikanza lya myaka makūmi anè, myaka mpungatī alī Hebuloni, myaka makūmi adatū n'idatū alī Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Solomoni ūbiza wigasha a h'isumbī lya būtemi lya ng'wa ise Daūdi; ū būtemi bokwe bongeja kūbiza na nguzu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Solomoni kūmūlaga Adonia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla ū Adonia ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Hagisi waja kūlī Batisheba, ū nina o ng'wa Solomoni. Ū Batisheba ūmūja, “Wiza mu mhola?” Nang'hwe ūshosha, “Ee mu mhola!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ongeja kūhaya, “Nalī na mhayo gwa kūkūwīla.” Ngikūlū ūshosha, “Hayaga dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nsūmba wandya kūhaya, “Mayū ūmanile hape gīkī ū būtemi walī wane gete, nīyo na a Baisilaeli a bose baalī balindanile dūhū gīkī nabasuge. Alīyo twahayimanīla yagaalūka ī mihayo, ū būtemi būja kūlī nzuna wane; nguno gashinaga h'ūmo kaalī a kūhelele ka ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ī haha nalī na mhayo; ūyo nalīkūlomba ūtizūnilemeja.” Ū ngikūlū ūshosha, “Bebe gūhayage dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Adonia ūhaya, “Nilombelage ū kūlī ntemi Solomoni nguno namanile gīkī ū bebe atīko kūkūlemeja mhayo; nombage aninhe ū Abishagi ū Nshunami abize nke wane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Batisheba ūshosha ūhaya, “Būgatū nakūhooya nang'hwe ū ntemi kūlwa nguno yako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Batisheba ūja ū kūlī ntemi Solomoni kūyomba nang'hwe kūlwa ng'wa Adonia, aho washika ū ntemi wīmīīla kūng'wegeleja ū nina, nīyo winama ū kū būtongi bokwe; hūna wigasha a h'isumbī lyakwe lya būtemi. Ūlagīja lyenhwa isumbī līngī enhelwe ū nina wa ntemi; wigasha kū nkono gwakwe gwa būlyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ūhaya, “Nalī na kamhayo kamò kado na kado ka kūkūlomba; ako nalīkūlomba ūtizūnilemeja.” Ū ntemi ūhaya, “Lombaga dūhū mayū, natūkūlemeja.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ngikūlū ūhaya, “Nzunīlījage ū nkūlūyo ū Adonia antoole ū Abishagi ū Nshunami.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi Solomoni ūnshokeja ū nina alīhaya, “Nibūlī ūlīnombela ū Adonia kwinhwa Abishagi ū Nshunami? Angū hambū hambū ni wanombela nū būtemi, nguno nīyo ū wei nkūlū wane. Yene nang'ho walomba ī chene; ka numho lūūlū nombelage nū ngabīji Abiasaali, pyī nū Yoabu ū ng'wana Seluya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi Solomoni wilahīla mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA alīhaya, “Ū Mulungu ni anitūlage hataale na kūtinda ho, ū Adonia ūlū atajimīīgije būpanga wakwe kūlwa būlombi wenūbū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūmo SEEBA alī mpanga ūyo wanitūūlile a h'isumbī lya būtemi lya ng'wa baba ū Daūdi, ūninha nguzu nī kaya ūnibeegeja gīt'ūmo walī wilahīlīla, ī lelo akūbūlagwa ū Adonia!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Solomoni ūnagīla ū Benaya ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehoyada, ūja ūūkantūla ū Adonia ūcha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abiasaali kūpeejiwa, Yoabu kūbūlagwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū ntemi ūng'wīla ū ngabīji Abiasaali, “Ū bebe nang'ho wigeleelilwe kūcha, alīyo shokaga Anasoosi kū malaale gako natūkūbūlagaga ī lelo. Nguno walī mūūcha w'isandīko lya ng'wa SEEBA Ndūji wa shose, kū būtongi bo ng'wa baba ū Daūdi; nang'ho wapandīka makoye mingī no aho ūlī hamò nū baba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Solomoni ūng'wīnja ū Abiasaali a ha būgabīji bo ng'wa SEEBA, gūshikīīla ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA ūyo walī wagūhaya Shilo kūlwa kaya ya ng'wa Eli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoabu aho wigwa ī mhola jenījo wilalīla, ūpeelela kwiheema lya ng'wa SEEBA, ūkūmīīla mhembe ja ha ng'walīlo; nguno nang'hwe walī wisangīja ū mu būgomi bo ng'wa Adonia, nūūlū īkī walī atisangīgije nī mihayo ya ng'wa Abusalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi Solomoni ūwīlwa, “Ū Yoabu wapeelaga kwiheema lya ng'wa SEEBA, ī haha wīmīīlaga bbihī na ng'walīlo.” Ū Solomoni ūnagīla Benaya ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehoyada; ūhaya, “Jaga koi ūkamūlage!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Benaya aho wingīla ū ng'wiheema lya ng'wa SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Yoabu, “Ū ntemi alīhaya, ‘Īngaga ho a henaho ūfume hanze!’” Nang'hwe ūshosha, “Biya ni nachīlage henaha!” Ū Benaya ūshosha ī mhola jenījo ū kūlī ntemi; ūūkahaya, “Ū Yoabu wanishokeja ūniwīla gīkī na gīkī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūng'wīla, “Ng'wītīlage ūmo wakūwīlīla; mūlagage ūnjīke. Ū mu gīko ūkūbiza wanīngīja ū nene hamò nī numba ya ng'wa baba ū kwihīga kūlwa mininga gatī na būbi ayo wagiita ū Yoabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA akūnīpīla wei ng'wenekīlī ū būbi wa kwita mininga; nguno akashisha banhū babīlī akūbibangaga wababūlaga na līlūshū, wiita mininga gabo aho ū baba walī atamanile. A banhū būbīlī wabo benabo, ū Abuneeli ng'witūnja o ng'wa Neeli, ūyo walī ntaale w'ibità lya Isilaeli, nū Amasa ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yaseeli, ūyo walī ntaale wa ibità lya Yuda, baalī bawiza na batūngīlīja kūtinda ū wei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kwihīga ūko kūlīho kūlwa mininga ga banhū benabo ni kūbizage ha ntwe go ng'wa Yoabu na shibyalīlwe shakwe shikū jose ja welelo na welelo. Alīyo ū kūlī Daūdi nī shibyalīlwe shakwe, nī kaya yakwe, nī lisumbī lyakwe lya būtemi, ni ībizage ho mhola shikū jose ja welelo na welelo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Benaya ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehoyada ūja ūūkantūla ū Yoabu ūmūlaga, ūjīkwa ha kaya yakwe, yalī kwitogolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūntūūla ū Benaya ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehoyada kūbiza ntaale w'ibità lya Isilaeli a ha ng'wanya go ng'wa Yoabu; ū Sadoki nang'hwe ūntūūla kūbiza ngabīji a ha ng'wanya go ng'wa Abiasaali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūbūlagwa kwa ng'wa Shimei",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ū ntemi ūtūma nhūng'wa ū kūlī Shimei kūng'wīla, “Zengaga numba mu Yelusalemu ūmu, wikale ng'wenūmu; yaya kūja ipandī līngī hose hose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwa kūlūkīla ū longa lwa Kiduloni wīnga ū ng'wenūmu ūlaacha; a mininga gako galabiza ha ntwe gwako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Shimei ūng'wīla ū ntemi, “Ūyo wagūhaya gwawiza, ū ntūmami wako akwīta gīt'ūmo wahayīla ū baba būgonzo ū ntemi.” Na ng'hana ū Shimei wikala ū mu Yelusalemu ikanza ilīhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho yabīta myaka idatū, basese bakwe babīlī būtoloka, būpeelela ng'wa Akishi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Maaka ntemi wa Gaasi; ū Shimei ūwīlwa, “A basese bako balī Gaasi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wigwa gīko ūlonja lonja nzobe yakwe ūdamhīla ūja ī ng'wa Akishi ī Gaasi kūbakūūbīja a basese bakwe; ūbiza waja ū Shimei; ūūkabenha a basese bakwe kūfuma ī Gaasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Solomoni ūwīlwa gīkī ū Shimei walī wīngile ī Yelusalemu, ūja Gaasi na kūshoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi ūng'witana ū Shimei ūng'wīla, “Natakwilahīgije mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA nūkūhūgūla nalīhaya gīkī, ‘Ū lūshikū lwa kwīnga na kūja kwipandī līngī managa gīkī numho waacha?’ Ī likanza lyenīlo ūkanishokeja ūhaya, ‘Ūyo wagūhaya gwenūyo gwawiza. Nakwīta chene.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nibūlī lūūlū walemeelilwe ū kūshidima ī shilahīlo shako ū kūlī SEEBA, nī shilagīlo īsho nakakwinha nene?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi ūng'wīla ū Shimei, “Ū bebe ng'wenekīlī ūbūmanile pyī ū būbi ūbo ūkang'wītīla baba ū Daūdi. Na lūūlū ī haha ū SEEBA akūkūlīpīla kūlwa nguno ya būbi wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ntemi Solomoni akongeja kwīlūkīlwa mbango, nī lisumbī lya būtemi ī lya ng'wa Daūdi līkwinhwa nguzu ja welelo bose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi ūnagīja ū Benaya ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehoyada; ūfuma hanze ūūkantūla ūmūlaga. Na lūūlū ū būtemi būguzuhiwa ū mu nkono go ng'wa Solomoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.2.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
